WEBVTT

WEBVTT

﻿1
00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:03.760
Bien.

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.760
This is the proposal.

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:14.840
The Aspen estate becomes a hotel.

00:00:16.840 --> 00:00:18.240
I already have

00:00:18.240 --> 00:00:19.960
your grandfather's signature.

00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:22.520
Now we just need yours.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:30.440
This house.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:33.440
It's all that's left of my parents.

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.400
It's their memory.

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:39.440
But who am I even telling this to?

00:00:39.440 --> 00:00:40.320
You don't understand

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:42.040
what family means.

00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:43.640
A real family.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:46.200
Maybe.

00:00:48.160 --> 00:00:49.960
But I do understand business.

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:51.440
And I know that this house

00:00:51.440 --> 00:00:53.360
drains a lot of money every month.

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.840
It can make it instead.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:55.760
No!

00:00:55.760 --> 00:00:57.240
You’ve already sold off

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.600
all the family’s antiques!

00:00:58.600 --> 00:01:00.400
Isn't that enough for you?

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:01.480
Oh, have you forgotten?

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:02.720
I forget nothing.

00:01:03.400 --> 00:01:04.800
And this house,

00:01:04.800 --> 00:01:06.240
it's just a building

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:09.240
with floor, walls and roof.

00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:11.200
It will never bring back your parents

00:01:11.200 --> 00:01:12.240
and your brother.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:19.440
Don't you dare say so.

00:01:20.120 --> 00:01:21.920
You grew up among savages.

00:01:21.920 --> 00:01:24.480
So nothing is sacred to you.

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:33.200
Veronica, stop.

00:01:38.120 --> 00:01:38.440
Okay.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.000
Come on. Shoot me.
